ne at once. It’s great for road trips, group activities, or just peace of mind when your kids are out and about.\n\nSharing your location is quick and easy — just tap a button, and the people in your circle can see where you are. And in case of emergency, there's an SOS feature that lets you send an alert with your location, so someone can come help right away.\n\nThis app isn’t about spying — it’s about safety, care, and staying connected in a simple, friendly way. You can use the app to check in with your kids, keep an eye on your travel group, or simply make sure your partner got to work safely. It’s an easy way to stay connected without any unnecessary complexity.\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1j5utGHyPsiNzvSbg9bIzhPzqh7y-i0lH4XlMZ_e8LIY/edit?usp=sharing\nTerms of Use: https://docs.google.com/document/d/152Z9qEKZ8SU1GGDZm8t0pKSjzkT7NV00xuJg53e_i9s/edit?usp=sharing", "averageUserRating": 0, "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "trackCensoredName": "나의 친구찾기: 커플 위치공유 추적", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/%EB%82%98%EC%9D%98-%EC%B9%9C%EA%B5%AC%EC%B0%BE%EA%B8%B0-%EC%BB%A4%ED%94%8C-%EC%9C%84%EC%B9%98%EA%B3%B5%EC%9C%A0-%EC%B6%94%EC%A0%81/id6747808734?uo=4", "minimumOsVersion": "16.0", "languageCodesISO2A": ["AR", "BG", "HR", "CS", "DA", "NL", "EN", "ET", "FI", "FR", "DE", "EL", "HE", "HI", "HU", "ID", "IT", "JA", "KO", "LV", "LT", "MS", "NB", "PL", "PT", "RO", "RU", "ZH", "SK", "SL", "ES", "SV", "TH", "ZH", "TR", "UK", "VI"], "fileSizeBytes": "224367616", "formattedPrice": "무료", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 0, "trackContentRating": "4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 0, "trackId": 6747808734, "trackName": "나의 친구찾기: 커플 위치공유 추적", "userRatingCount": 0}]}